   "file": "TauCeti/Combinatorics/Graph/Serre/Reduction.lean",
   "fix": "Add `theorem Path.Homotopic.equivalence : Equivalence (Path.Homotopic \u0393 (a := a) (b := b))` and a `Path.Homotopic.setoid` definition, and tag the constructors `@[refl]`, `@[symm]` and `@[trans]`.",
   "issue": "`Path.Homotopic` has reflexivity, symmetry and transitivity only as constructors. There is no `Equivalence` theorem or `Setoid` to quotient by for the \u00a72.2 reduced-loop / graph-group construction this PR says it prepares.",
